          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Climb aboard a sleek jet plane for a calm and cozy flight through the night! In this relaxing bedtime story, you'll settle into a comfy seat, snuggle under warm covers, and listen to the gentle hum of the engines as the plane soars through the starry sky. \n\nHelp prepare for takeoff: close the door, dim the lights, and feel the plane gently lift off the ground. As you fly through the clouds, the soft rumble of the jet will help you drift off to sleep.  \n\nAfter the story, the soothing sounds of the plane’s flight will continue playing for a whole hour, creating a peaceful atmosphere to keep you relaxed until you're fast asleep.  \n\nVoiced by Harriet Blackamore, Sound Design by Emma Mills, Written & Produced by Neil Mossey.",
